texts or presentations about common technology. "}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking About Future Actions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use two different tenses to talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>You use <span class=\"italic\"> will</span> for predictions about actions or situations in the future. It can also be used for situations you cannot control or decisions made at the moment of speaking.</li>  <li>You use <span class=\"italic\"> going to</span> for intentions, plans or ambitions.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject + will + main verb <br> Question word + will + subject + main verb?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Spending time together will be good for the two of you.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to<span class=\\\"strong\\\">\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Subject + am/is/are/ + going to + main verb <br> Question word + am/is/are + subject + main verb?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> You're going to have so much fun.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "What will you do if you can't find anything there?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "We'll take the bus early on Friday. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "We'll come back on Monday."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We'll spend the weekend getting ideas for new recipes. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You're going to have so much fun."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Questions with Sentences / Asking for Clarification"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Embedded questions</span> are often used to ask for clarification. An  <span class=\"strong\">embedded question</span> is a question that has a sentence structure within it. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "An <span class=\"strong\">embedded question</span> builds on a simple question."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:  <br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Simple question</span>: Where are you going to stay?<span class=\"strong\"><br/>Embedded question</span>:   Do you know where you're going to stay?</span> <br> <br>You can use <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>, like <span class=\"italic\">Can you tell me ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Do you know if/which/what ... ?</span> to ask for clarification. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart below for some more examples:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Main Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Embedded Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you know\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what you're going to do?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you have any idea\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" how busy that neighborhood is?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can you tell me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what time the dinner starts?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Could you tell me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when I have to be there?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you have any idea\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"who is in charge of the plans?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you have any idea how busy that neighborhood is?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you know where you're going to stay?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to look up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to improve"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Things are looking up with Marco."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob10aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you make plans for the immediate future."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to improvise"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to do something without prior preparation"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We're thinking of staying downtown. We'll improvise."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob10aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to play it by ear"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to improvise"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: What will you do if you can't find anywhere to stay? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: We'll play it by ear."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob10aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to iron out"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to resolve differences; to work things out"}, {"type": "part_speech", "co