pe": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "image": "engenn7le01ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Hey, V. You look relaxed today. Did you have a good day at work?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Work was alright. Customers were quite generous with their tips and my waiters felt happy about it.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        I bet! Do you have anything exciting planned for the weekend?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    As a matter of fact, I do. Things are looking up with Marco.", "time": "100", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le01ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        That's so exciting! Do you know what you're going to do?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    We are thinking of going to Montreal. We'll take the bus early on Friday. We'll spend the weekend getting ideas for new recipes. We'll come back on Monday.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        You're going to have so much fun. Do you know where you're going to stay?", "time": "18000", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le01ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    We haven't booked anything yet. We're thinking of staying downtown. We'll just improvise, I guess.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Do you have any idea how busy that neighborhood is? What will you do if you can't find anything there?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    We'll play it by ear. I'm just excited that Marco and I are ironing out our differences.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        I'm sure that spending time together will be good for the two of you.", "time": "35000", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le01ob10re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le01ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le01ob10re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}